# DeshiCart — environment variables
# Copy this file to `.env` and fill in real values:
#   cp .env.example .env
#
# Never commit `.env` (it is git-ignored). Never paste real
# credentials into docs, issues, or chat.

# REQUIRED — PostgreSQL connection string.
# Used by the app (src/db/index.ts) and by drizzle-kit (drizzle.config.ts).
# Production (Vercel): use your Neon pooled connection string and set it in
# the Vercel dashboard (Project → Settings → Environment Variables) for
# Production, Preview, and Development as needed.
# Example (placeholder — not a real credential):
DATABASE_URL="postgresql://USER:PASSWORD@ep-xxxx-xxxx-pooler.c-5.us-east-2.aws.neon.tech/neondb?sslmode=require&channel_binding=require"

# OPTIONAL — standard Node environment flag.
# Vercel sets this automatically; set locally only if you need to force it.
# NODE_ENV="development"
